    "one_liner": "A comprehensive analytical report on the 14,875 active satellites currently orbiting Earth, examining constellation composition, orbital regime distribution, and key orbital characteristics.",
    "goal": "Provide the reader with a clear, data-driven picture of the current satellite population: who operates the most satellites, how they are distributed across orbital regimes (LEO/MEO/GEO/HEO), what the dominant orbital parameters look like, and what trends in launch activity and constellation growth can be inferred from the catalog."
